    {
      "i": 9,
      "lines": [
        184,
        184
      ],
      "raw": "The [Create a Payment](https://modulr.readme.io/reference/sendpayment) endpoint is used to move money from one Modulr account to another Modulr account.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "The Create a Payment endpoint is used to move money from one Modulr account to another Modulr account.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": [
        {
          "kind": "absoluteInternalLink",
          "value": "https://modulr.readme.io/reference/sendpayment",
          "line": 184
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "lines": [
        186,
        186
      ],
      "raw": "On the sending account (payer) there will be a payment and debit transaction and the PAYOUT webhook will trigger.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "On the sending account (payer) there will be a payment and debit transaction and the PAYOUT webhook will trigger.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "lines": [
        188,
        188
      ],
      "raw": "On the receiving account (payee) there will be a payment and a credit transaction and the PAYIN webhook will trigger.",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "syntax": "markdown",
      "text": "On the receiving account (payee) there will be a payment and a credit transaction and the PAYIN webhook will trigger.",
      "target": {
        "component": null,
        "status": "direct"
      },
      "inline": []
    },
    {
